OL,3,GNEWSABradley Lowery holiday home
OL,4,Afinally opens doors
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for the #1.2m house, named Super
OL,7,FBrad's Pad, were approved in 2019 and
OL,8,Fit was officially opened on Tuesday by
OL,9,Fformer Sunderland striker Jermain
OL,10,FDefoe, who forged a close friendship
OL,11,Fwith Bradley during his illness.
